		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=215" title="View the profile of Turboo">Turboo</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 13<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Phat fookin moron!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=215"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:tubs@byggplan.se"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg1545#msg1545"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg1545#msg1545">Re:And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #3 on:</b> August 31, 2003, 02:04:43 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Not that im eager to place Verzi high in ranking, but using Emp/VT to measure with is kinda outdated i think, cause for instance i dont belive Verzi aiming to ever go there . I dont know if any other guild out there thinking of passing on Emp n VT.<br />But i for one belive that u can advance without going there, since the introduction of Ornate armor etc etc, Clerics can get max FT &nbsp;and decent resists without going to VT without any problems, aswell as the rest of the casters.<br /><br /> 
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
