						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg1661#msg1661"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg1661#msg1661">Re:And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #13 on:</b> September 15, 2003, 09:19:35 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Is RoS VT keyed?<br /><br />If not I'd still keep them just under Forsaken, for the moment, since Forsaken can very quickly gear new applicants, alts and bots there. Especially casters.<br /><br />VT being the candystore it is they can backfarm it.<br /><br />RoS, without VT access has to scour PoP for similar quality drops.
						</td>
